Sat Oct 24 18:55:04 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 2.0.0:
  * Search within the current view (/ to search, n/N for next and
    previous match) and improved tree UI
  * Parse command line arguments with argparse
  * Check the installed grype version and warn when it is outdated
  * Loading screen and notifications for long-running operations
  * Sort views by package name, vulnerability ID, package type
    or severity
  * Fix crash when pressing 'e' without a selected vulnerability
  * Fix SBOM encoding error on Windows
- Switch Source to the PyPI sdist
- Follow the upstream rename of the launcher from grummage to
  grummage.py
- Drop unused update-alternatives Requires without scriptlets

